mw2coop patch for maps/af_chase_code.gsc (Endgame boat chase; the same script in the af_chase and ending
zones; Modern Warfare 2, 64-bit Steam build). Generated by tools/gen_boat_patches.py; do not
edit by hand. Co-op logic lives in mw2coop/scripts/maps/_mw2coop_boat.gsc. Outside a co-op
campaign session level.mw2coop_lead is level.player and every change does what the original did.

1. Boarding: the player who sets off the jetty trigger drives; once he is on the boat the
   other player takes the seat across from Price as a gunner.
@@@ subst trigger_boat_mount
self waittill( "trigger" );
@@@ to
self waittill( "trigger", mw2coop_who );
	maps\_mw2coop_boat::boat_mount( mw2coop_who );
@@@ end
@@@ subst setup_boat_for_drive
flag_set( "player_on_boat" );
@@@ to
flag_set( "player_on_boat" );
	maps\_mw2coop_boat::boat_boarded();
@@@ end

2. Death in the boat: nobody can revive anyone there, so either player going down is the
   single player death (the boat flips, the mission fails); the passenger rolls with it.
@@@ subst flip_when_player_dies
level.player waittill( "death" );
@@@ to
maps\_mw2coop_boat::boat_rider_down();
@@@ end
@@@ subst flip_when_player_dies
level.player PlayerSetGroundReferenceEnt( offset_obj );
@@@ to
level.player PlayerSetGroundReferenceEnt( offset_obj );
	maps\_mw2coop_boat::boat_flip_partner( offset_obj );
@@@ end
@@@ subst flip_when_player_dies
