3. Price keeps his tube: two gunners cover a side each (owner, 2026-10-21: no turning over),
   so the level's position triggers and the rapids' automatic turning leave him in his "left"
   pose, the one the level gives him by default, and the passenger lies across from him.
@@@ subst price_position_switch
level.price.scripted_boat_pose = self.script_noteworthy;
@@@ to
if ( !maps\_mw2coop_boat::price_keeps_tube() )
		level.price.scripted_boat_pose = self.script_noteworthy;
@@@ end
@@@ subst set_price_auto_switch_pose
level.price.scripted_boat_pose = undefined;
@@@ to
if ( maps\_mw2coop_boat::price_keeps_tube() )
		return;
	level.price.scripted_boat_pose = undefined;
@@@ end

